{"id":"663827","name":"春笋焖鸭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663827/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"春笋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸭肉洗净斩块。","img":"images/663827/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜洗净切块。","img":"images/663827/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"春笋处理好切块。","img":"images/663827/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油炒香姜片。","img":"images/663827/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入鸭肉翻炒炒干水份。","img":"images/663827/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/663827/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/663827/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/663827/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖40分钟左右。","img":"images/663827/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"春笋焯水处理好。","img":"images/663827/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鸭肉焖至软烂。","img":"images/663827/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入焯过水的春笋，翻炒均匀焖15分钟左右。","img":"images/663827/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663827/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663827/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}